{"id":"muhammad-akif-janjua/notion-guard","name":"Notion Guard","version":"1.0.5","publisher_pubkey":"e469d55383447fc6b95cbffb786fee7cc5c998c9dbe3143e7eec8ad210524540","provider":"notion","category":"Governance","auth":{"type":"api_key","vault_provider":"notion","header":"Authorization","secret_field":"NOTION_API_KEY","docs":"https://www.notion.so/my-integrations"},"credential_spec":{"provider":"notion","category":"Docs & Workspace","name":"Notion","required":["NOTION_API_KEY"],"optional":[],"shape":"dict","risk":"medium","read_write":"write"},"allowed_destinations":[{"provider":"notion","hosts":["api.notion.com"]}],"provider_list":["notion"],"requires":{"network":["api.notion.com"],"subprocess":false,"filesystem_writes":[]},"description":"Notion Guard is a governance-first Notion integration for small teams that want AI-assisted page and database work without silent or unrestricted changes.\n\nCommands: notion.search (search pages/data sources shared with the integration); notion.get_data_source_schema (inspect a data source's property names, types, option values); notion.query_data_source (filter/sort/page a data source's rows); notion.get_page (read one page's properties); notion.get_page_content (read a page's or block's content); notion.list_users (list workspace users, for addressing people by name); notion.create_page (create a page, approval-gated); notion.update_page_properties (update properties or trash status, approval-gated); notion.append_blocks (append content blocks, approval-gated); notion.create_comment (add a comment or discussion reply, approval-gated).\n\nSix reads execute immediately. Four approval-gated writes use RailCall's preview-approve-execute flow; Notion changes only after a human approves the exact payload.\n\nReal Notion REST API, no mocks. Checks HTTP status on every response, treats network failures and 5xx responses during a write as an unknown outcome, never auto-retries a mutation, never presents a failed operation as successful.\n\nQuick start: create an internal integration at https://www.notion.so/my-integrations, share pages/databases with it, save the secret as NOTION_API_KEY on the muhammad-akif-janjua-notion-guard::notion card in RailCall Studio Integrations (not the plain notion card), reload Modules, begin with notion.search then notion.get_data_source_schema before your first write.\n\nLimitations: only sees pages/databases shared with it. Results are bounded for readable receipts.\n\nBuilt for the RailCall Track A module contest.\n\ncontest:2026Q3\n\nZero model-provider destinations in the signed manifest. Notion REST traffic is the only business integration path, not an LLM call; the handler never invokes a model-provider SDK or RailCall model-completion primitive.","commands":[{"id":"notion.search","title":"Search Notion","provider":"notion","risk":"low","mode":"read","requires":[],"preview":true,"receipt_required":true,"input_schema":{"query":{"type":"string","required":false},"object_type":{"type":"string","required":false},"start_cursor":{"type":"string","required":false},"page_size":{"type":"number","required":false}},"output_schema":{"returned_count":"number","results_json":"string","next_cursor":"string","has_more":"boolean","http_status":"number"}},{"id":"notion.get_data_source_schema","title":"Get Notion Data Source Schema","provider":"notion","risk":"low","mode":"read","requires":[],"preview":true,"receipt_required":true,"input_schema":{"data_source_id":{"type":"string","required":false},"database_id":{"type":"string","required":false}},"output_schema":{"data_source_id":"string","title":"string","property_count":"number","properties_json":"string","http_status":"number"}},{"id":"notion.query_data_source","title":"Query a Notion Data Source","provider":"notion","risk":"low","mode":"read","requires":[],"preview":true,"receipt_required":true,"input_schema":{"data_source_id":{"type":"string","required":true},"filter_json":{"type":"string","required":false},"sorts_json":{"t